kind	plugin	Claude Code plugins	puzzlepiece.extension	Marketplaces in ~/.claude/plugins/marketplaces, updated with `claude plugin marketplace update` and `claude plugin update`.	true	claude
kind	gitSkill	Git-cloned skills	arrow.triangle.branch	Git repos in each agent's skills folder (~/.claude/skills, ~/.agents/skills, ~/.gemini/skills, ~/.config/opencode/skills, ~/.cursor/skills; symlinks followed), updated with `git pull --ff-only`.	true	
kind	uv	uv tools	shippingbox	Tools from `uv tool install`, such as graphify. Updated with `uv tool upgrade`.	true	
kind	pipx	pipx tools	cube.box	Tools from `pipx install`. Updated with `pipx upgrade`.	true	
kind	npm	npm global packages	cube	Packages from `npm install -g`. Off by default because it lists every global package.	false	
kind	claudeCode	Claude Code	terminal	The `claude` command in your terminal. A Homebrew install is updated with `brew upgrade --cask claude-code`. The Claude desktop app updates its own copy.	true	claude
kind	codexPlugin	Codex plugin marketplaces	puzzlepiece.extension	Git marketplaces in ~/.codex/.tmp/marketplaces, updated with `codex plugin marketplace upgrade`, which also refreshes their installed plugins.	true	codex
kind	codexCLI	Codex CLI	terminal	The `codex` command. Updated with `codex update`, which handles Homebrew, npm and the install script.	true	codex
kind	geminiExtension	Gemini CLI extensions	puzzlepiece.extension	Extensions in ~/.gemini/extensions, updated with `gemini extensions update`. Linked extensions are skipped, and an update that needs your consent has to be run in a terminal.	true	gemini
kind	antigravityPlugin	Antigravity plugins	puzzlepiece.extension	Plugins installed with `agy plugin install` from a git repo, checked against that repo and updated by installing them again with `agy`, which keeps their enabled state.	true	antigravity
kind	antigravityCLI	Antigravity CLI	terminal	The `agy` command, Google's replacement for Gemini CLI. Updated with `agy update`.	true	antigravity
